msgstr "Field mapping"

#: cards/templates/cards/anki_map.html:49
msgid ""
"Les cartes arrivent en boîte 1. Sont ignorées les notes dont la question "
"existe déjà dans le paquet, ou dont la question ou la réponse est vide ou "
"dépasse 200 caractères. Un exemple de plus de 500 caractères est raccourci."
msgstr ""
"Cards go into box 1. Notes are skipped when their question is already in the "
"deck, or when the question or answer is empty or longer than 200 characters. "
"An example longer than 500 characters is shortened."

