msgstr "Cancel"

#: cards/templates/cards/anki_upload.html:34
msgid ""
"Vous choisirez ensuite quels champs du paquet servent de question, de "
"réponse et d'exemple."
msgstr ""
"You will then choose which fields of the deck are used as question, answer "
"and example."

#: cards/templates/cards/anki_upload.html:40
msgid "Où trouver des paquets ?"
msgstr "Where to find decks?"

#: cards/templates/cards/anki_upload.html:42
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Des milliers de paquets partagés gratuits sont sur <a href=\"https://ankiweb."
"net/shared/decks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">AnkiWeb</a> (fichiers "
"<code>.apkg</code>). Les cartes seront ajoutées à « %(name)s », en boîte 1."
msgstr ""
"Thousands of free shared decks are on <a href=\"https://ankiweb.net/shared/"
"decks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">AnkiWeb</a> (<code>.apkg</code> "
"files). The cards will be added to “%(name)s”, in box 1."

#: cards/templates/cards/anki_upload.html:49
msgid ""
"Le texte est repris sans mise en forme ; les sons et les images sont ignorés "
"(le bouton <i class=\"bi bi-volume-up\"></i> lit les cartes avec la synthèse "
"vocale)."
msgstr ""
"Text is imported without formatting; sounds and images are skipped (the <i "
"class=\"bi bi-volume-up\"></i> button reads cards aloud with speech "
"synthesis)."

